♪ I'll rise up

811
00:46:49,840 --> 00:46:51,960
♪ I'll rise unafraid

812
00:46:52,040 --> 00:46:54,080
♪ I'll rise up

813
00:46:54,160 --> 00:46:58,160
♪ And I'll do it a thousand times again

814
